WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:14.738
Danny: Okay. Let’s explore!

2
00:00:14.739 --> 00:00:17.250
Brad: Let’s stick together this time.

3
00:00:17.251 --> 00:00:20.722
Danny: I think that’s a safe rule to follow.

4
00:00:20.723 --> 00:00:24.436
Tina: Follow me, boys!

5
00:00:24.437 --> 00:00:27.262
Tina: Look at this beautiful garden!

6
00:00:27.263 --> 00:00:29.787
Tina: Have you ever seen anything like it?

7
00:00:29.788 --> 00:00:34.343
Danny: Never. There are more flowers than I’ve ever seen!

8
00:00:34.344 --> 00:00:36.857
Brad: Ah-choo!

9
00:00:36.858 --> 00:00:40.177
Tina: What’s the matter, Brad?

10
00:00:40.178 --> 00:00:41.891
Brad: Allergies.

11
00:00:41.892 --> 00:00:44.460
Danny: You’re allergic to flowers?

12
00:00:44.461 --> 00:00:45.650
Brad: I’ll be okay.

13
00:00:45.651 --> 00:00:49.685
It’s just a little tickle in my nose.

14
00:00:49.686 --> 00:00:56.942
Brad: But I guess when there are so many . . .

15
00:00:56.943 --> 00:00:59.540
Tina: We'd better find a way out of here.

16
00:00:59.541 --> 00:01:03.042
Danny: Hey, what’s that over there?

17
00:01:03.043 --> 00:01:05.272
Tina: It looks like apple trees!

18
00:01:05.273 --> 00:01:08.290
Danny: I am so hungry!

19
00:01:08.291 --> 00:01:16.586
Tina: I could eat a whole tree!

20
00:01:16.587 --> 00:01:22.760
Danny: Here, Brad, try an apple.

21
00:01:22.761 --> 00:01:24.979
Brad: I prefer oranges.

22
00:01:24.980 --> 00:01:27.286
Danny: Where did you find that?

23
00:01:27.287 --> 00:01:29.770
Tina: Over here, Danny!

24
00:01:29.771 --> 00:01:34.262
Brad: Follow me.

25
00:01:34.263 --> 00:01:37.663
Tina: Look! There’s a whole bunch of orange trees too!

26
00:01:37.664 --> 00:01:41.097
Brad: And over here, there are lemon trees!

27
00:01:41.098 --> 00:01:43.693
Danny: What’s that over there?

28
00:01:43.694 --> 00:01:46.136
Tina & Brad: Bananas!

29
00:01:46.137 --> 00:01:49.928
Brad: Do you still think this is the giants’ world, Danny?

30
00:01:49.929 --> 00:01:52.423
Danny: No. It’s too colorful.

31
00:01:52.424 --> 00:01:54.700
So what should we do?

32
00:01:54.701 --> 00:01:58.951
Tina: Stay here and eat forever?

33
00:01:58.952 --> 00:02:03.605
Brad: Ah-choo! I don’t think that will work for me.

34
00:02:03.606 --> 00:02:07.024
Tina: Right. Well, where do we go next?

35
00:02:07.025 --> 00:02:09.948
Danny: Let’s think about this for a minute.

36
00:02:09.949 --> 00:02:13.833
Danny: The blue key got us to a world full of water.

37
00:02:13.834 --> 00:02:18.005
Brad: The red key brought us to a world full of snow.

38
00:02:18.006 --> 00:02:23.332
Tina: But really it is a world of flowers and fruit!

39
00:02:23.333 --> 00:02:28.570
Brad: Right. Danny, what other colors do you have?

40
00:02:28.571 --> 00:02:32.287
Danny: Yellow.

41
00:02:32.288 --> 00:02:34.114
Tina: Yellow.

42
00:02:34.115 --> 00:02:35.671
Brad: Yellow.

43
00:02:35.672 --> 00:02:38.739
Danny: What does it mean?

44
00:02:38.740 --> 00:02:42.968
Brad: Do you think the yellow clay is the key to the giants’ world?

45
00:02:42.969 --> 00:02:44.436
Danny: I don’t know.

46
00:02:44.437 --> 00:02:47.019
What else could yellow be for?

47
00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:48.704
Tina: Bananas?

48
00:02:48.705 --> 00:02:52.743
Brad: The point is we just don’t know.

49
00:02:52.744 --> 00:02:55.672
Brad: Do we want to take the chance again?

50
00:02:55.673 --> 00:02:58.598
Danny: What other choice do we have?

51
00:02:58.599 --> 00:03:02.087
Tina: Danny’s right. We don’t even know how to get home.

52
00:03:02.088 --> 00:03:06.440
Brad: So we need to try the yellow clay? Agreed?

53
00:03:06.441 --> 00:03:11.773
Danny & Tina: Agreed!
